{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25158","headline":"客舍喜友人相访 · 贺兰朋吉","name":"客舍喜友人相访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒居无四隣，谁肯访来频。\n古树秋中叶，他乡病里身。\n鴈声风送急，萤影月流新。\n独爲成名晚，多慙见友人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰朋吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}